
 How to play
   The secret is 5 different colors, chosen from:
     K=Black W=White R=Red B=Blue G=Green Y=Yellow P=Pink O=Orange
   Type a guess as 5 letters: RGYBK, r g y b k or R,G,Y,B,K.
   After each guess:
     ● a right color in the right spot
     △ a right color in the wrong spot
     The symbols don't say which pegs they mean, except on
     Easy, where each one sits in the spot of its peg.
   You have 12 rows. Solve sooner to score more:
     rows 1–4: 12 · 5–6: 10 · 7–8: 8 · 9–10: 6 · 11–12: 4
   The first player to reach 30 points wins a match.
   Type q to quit.
